package: zigbee
description: This component manages a ring buffer of binary entries.  Each entry has a 1- or 2-byte length field that is recorded to manage the buffer.  This ring buffer can be used by multiple entities as the buffer space for the ring buffer is allocated by the caller.
id: zigbee_ring_buffer
label: Ring Buffer
category: Zigbee|Utility
quality: production
provides:
- name: zigbee_ring_buffer
source:
- path: app/framework/plugin/ring-buffer/ring-buffer.c
include:
- path: app/framework/plugin/ring-buffer
  file_list:
  - path: ring-buffer.h
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: zigbee_ring_buffer

documentation:
  docset: zigbee
  document: zigbee-af-api/ring-buffer
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: zigbee
